        "title": "Add verify checks to Layer 2 sponsored skill schema",
        "summary": "The Layer 2 sponsored skill schema in `common/src/ads/sponsored-skill-layer2.ts` now accepts an optional `verify` array, limited to `LAYER2_MAX_VERIFY` items, where each entry defines a case-insensitive regex check against source files. In `compileLayer2Skill`, these entries become `file_contains` checks that run before package and environment checks, allowing advertisers to prove that specific integration code (such as SDK imports) exists in the project. The instruction template for the agent step was also updated to frame these as guidelines the agent adapts rather than a rigid script, ensuring the wording never reads as user work.",
